{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1333930/extras/Welcome_To_The_Chaos.png?t=1739345454\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1333930/extras/Doug_Smack_Toilet_Gif_V4.gif?t=1739345454\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">World's Worst Handyman plunges you into a world of comedy and stealth. Play as Doug, a disastrously unskilled handyman with a heart of gold. Embark on a heartwarming mission to save his beloved animal shelter from bankruptcy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you navigate through chaotic job sites, brace yourself\u2014anything that can go wrong will go spectacularly wrong!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1333930/extras/Doug_Tree_Chop_Gif.gif?t=1739345454\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1333930/extras/You_re_Hired.png?t=1739345454\" />Doug\u2019s shockingly affordable handyman skills are in high demand! Take on repairs in the most unusual settings\u2014from spooky farms to space stations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No job is too small, too strange, or too dangerous. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Equip yourself with an assortment of tools, from hammers to katanas, and tackle everything that comes your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1333930/extras/Scarecrow_Sneak.gif?t=1739345454\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1333930/extras/Master_The_Art_Of_Stealth.png?t=1739345454\" />Being sneaky is more than a skill\u2014it's an art. Dodge angry residents, from gamer grandmas to laser-wielding cats. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep your cool, blend in, and if you break something\u2014just act casual, whistle a tune, and maybe no one will notice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1333930/extras/Penguin_Pet.gif?t=1739345454\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1333930/extras/Earn_Cash_To_Save_The_Animal_Shelter.png?t=1739345454\" />Every job completed, no matter how chaotic, earns you cash to save the local animal shelter. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your ultimate goal? Prevent the animal shelter from going bankrupt\u2014their wagging tails depend on you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1333930/extras/Hammer_Raise_Gif.gif?t=1739345454\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1333930/extras/Become_A_Hero.png?t=1739345454\" />World's Worst Handyman features stylized visuals and a playful blend of physics, stealth, and puzzles. It's bound to charm fans of Untitled Goose Game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embrace the mayhem, save the animal shelter, and prove that even the world's worst handyman can be a hero!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1333930/extras/Game_Features.png?t=1739345454\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The best of intentions. The worst of abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Task list of odd and potentially dangerous jobs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Eccentric clients (possibly ulterior motives).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uptight neighbors that take property damage personally. May hunt you down.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fanny pack full of tools, keys, and whatever else you may discover (finders keepers!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cute, stray animals (yes, they are pettable) needing a home.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hidden collectibles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Minigames.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Community Pet Board\u2014Submit photos of your pets on Discord to be featured in game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Original music by J. Scott Rakozy, composer from Hogwarts Legacy (Streaming Friendly Soundtrack).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1333930?t=1739345454","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1333930?t=1739345454","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1333930/bb65a69b1852d47f75cffe5bb0d86f57200adf3a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1739345454","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1333930/bb65a69b1852d47f75cffe5bb0d86f57200adf3a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1739345454","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":1942320,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1333930/extras/Welcome_To_The_Chaos.png?t=1739345454\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1333930/extras/Doug_Smack_Toilet_Gif_V4.gif?t=1739345454\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">World's Worst Handyman plunges you into a world of comedy and stealth. Play as Doug, a disastrously unskilled handyman with a heart of gold. Embark on a heartwarming mission to save his beloved animal shelter from bankruptcy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you navigate through chaotic job sites, brace yourself\u2014anything that can go wrong will go spectacularly wrong!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1333930/extras/Doug_Tree_Chop_Gif.gif?t=1739345454\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1333930/extras/You_re_Hired.png?t=1739345454\" />Doug\u2019s shockingly affordable handyman skills are in high demand! Take on repairs in the most unusual settings\u2014from spooky farms to space stations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No job is too small, too strange, or too dangerous. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Equip yourself with an assortment of tools, from hammers to katanas, and tackle everything that comes your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1333930/extras/Scarecrow_Sneak.gif?t=1739345454\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1333930/extras/Master_The_Art_Of_Stealth.png?t=1739345454\" />Being sneaky is more than a skill\u2014it's an art. Dodge angry residents, from gamer grandmas to laser-wielding cats. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep your cool, blend in, and if you break something\u2014just act casual, whistle a tune, and maybe no one will notice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1333930/extras/Penguin_Pet.gif?t=1739345454\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1333930/extras/Earn_Cash_To_Save_The_Animal_Shelter.png?t=1739345454\" />Every job completed, no matter how chaotic, earns you cash to save the local animal shelter. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your ultimate goal? Prevent the animal shelter from going bankrupt\u2014their wagging tails depend on you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1333930/extras/Hammer_Raise_Gif.gif?t=1739345454\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1333930/extras/Become_A_Hero.png?t=1739345454\" />World's Worst Handyman features stylized visuals and a playful blend of physics, stealth, and puzzles. It's bound to charm fans of Untitled Goose Game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embrace the mayhem, save the animal shelter, and prove that even the world's worst handyman can be a hero!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1333930/extras/Game_Features.png?t=1739345454\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The best of intentions. The worst of abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Task list of odd and potentially dangerous jobs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Eccentric clients (possibly ulterior motives).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uptight neighbors that take property damage personally. May hunt you down.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fanny pack full of tools, keys, and whatever else you may discover (finders keepers!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cute, stray animals (yes, they are pettable) needing a home.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hidden collectibles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Minigames.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Community Pet Board\u2014Submit photos of your pets on Discord to be featured in game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Original music by J. Scott Rakozy, composer from Hogwarts Legacy (Streaming Friendly Soundtrack).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Baby Lumberjack"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1333930/header.jpg?t=1739345454","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a92025 Baby Lumberjack","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257028380,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257028380/movie480.mp4?t=1717532918","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257028380/movie_max.mp4?t=1717532918"},"name":"June 2024 Gameplay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257028380/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1717532918","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257028380/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1717532918","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257028380/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1717532918"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257016810,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257016810/movie480.mp4?t=1717532922","max":"http://video.aka